  "$comment": "C40 slc-abil-staff-tech-ctrl — technicians or technical bodies responsible for quality control (Part IV §C). Both-sides: buyer REQUIREMENT (lots + requirement text) and EO RESPONSE (fulfilled-by-itself -> relied-upon entity; a REPEATABLE technicians[] list and a REPEATABLE bodies[] list, each row carrying its own electronic-evidence sub-block; plus a top-level additional-evidence block). Sibling of slc-abil-staff-tech-work (C41), which is identical minus the QSG3/Q1 NONE caption.",

